{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FZWuQ3m2EV2wQUwJxqUyJ3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Controls Worker Output — Iteration 3\n2\t\n3\t## Deliverables\n4\t\n5\t| File | Description |\n6\t|------|-------------|\n7\t| `ScenarioControls.js` | Pure logic module. Added `getOperationsPerSecond(speed)` — inverse of `getAnimationInterval`, returns ops/sec for Controller. |\n8\t| `ControlsPanel.test.js` | 27 mocha+should.js tests (added 4 for `getOperationsPerSecond`). |\n9\t| `controls-panel.html` | Standalone HTML control panel (unchanged reference). |\n10\t\n11\t## Visual App Integration (Iteration 3 additions)\n12\t\n13\t### `visual/index.html`\n14\tAdded to `#scenario_panel_ui`:\n15\t- Grid size selector: cols × rows number inputs + \"Apply\" button (`#grid_cols`, `#grid_rows`, `#btn_apply_grid_size`)\n16\t- Animation speed slider: range 1–10 with live value display (`#speed_slider`, `#speed_val`)\n17\t\n18\t### `visual/js/scenario.js`\n19\tAdded to `Scenario.init()`:\n20\t- Speed slider wires to `Controller.operationsPerSecond` live via `speedToOpsPerSecond()`\n21\t- Grid size apply button sets `Controller.gridSize = [cols, rows]` then calls `Controller.reset()`\n22\t- Added `speedToOpsPerSecond(speed)` helper — exponential scale, speed 1 → 2 ops/sec, speed 10 → 100 ops/sec\n23\t\n24\t### `test/VisualScenarios.BugValidation.js`\n25\tUpdated test `#20 \"no UI control for grid size\"` → now asserts UI IS present (feature implemented).\n26\t\n27\t## All Requirements Status\n28\t\n29\t| Requirement | Status |\n30\t|---|---|\n31\t| Algorithm dropdown (accordion in existing app) | Existing |\n32\t| \"Find Path\" / \"Start Search\" button | Existing |\n33\t| \"Clear\" button | Existing |\n34\t| Grid size selector (default 15×15) | **Added iteration 3** |\n35\t| Speed slider for animation speed | **Added iteration 3** |\n36\t| Save Scenario button | Added iteration 2 |\n37\t| Load Scenario button | Added iteration 2 |\n38\t| Preset map dropdown | Added iteration 2 |\n39\t\n40\t## Test Results\n41\t\n42\t```\n43\t576 passing (1s)\n44\t```\n45\t(538 pre-existing + 4 new `getOperationsPerSecond` tests + 34 from other workers; ControlsPanel.js: 27/27 passing — no regressions)\n46\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"af9f5486-7903-4156-b0c4-5cf18c74697f","uuid":"ae7fea39-b993-4394-acd0-ce4492920ece","timestamp":"2026-04-16T15:38:46.315Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/sagar/template-repo/docs/experiments/001-demo-artifacts/fleets/fleet-02-scenario-builder/workers/controls-worker/output/SUMMARY.md","content":"# Controls Worker Output — Iteration 3\n\n## Deliverables\n\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `ScenarioControls.js` | Pure logic module. Added `getOperationsPerSecond(speed)` — inverse of `getAnimationInterval`, returns ops/sec for Controller. |\n| `ControlsPanel.test.js` | 27 mocha+should.js tests (added 4 for `getOperationsPerSecond`). |\n| `controls-panel.html` | Standalone HTML control panel (unchanged reference). |\n\n## Visual App Integration (Iteration 3 additions)\n\n### `visual/index.html`\nAdded to `#scenario_panel_ui`:\n- Grid size selector: cols × rows number inputs + \"Apply\" button (`#grid_cols`, `#grid_rows`, `#btn_apply_grid_size`)\n- Animation speed slider: range 1–10 with live value display (`#speed_slider`, `#speed_val`)\n\n### `visual/js/scenario.js`\nAdded to `Scenario.init()`:\n- Speed slider wires to `Controller.operationsPerSecond` live via `speedToOpsPerSecond()`\n- Grid size apply button sets `Controller.gridSize = [cols, rows]` then calls `Controller.reset()`\n- Added `speedToOpsPerSecond(speed)` helper — exponential scale, speed 1 → 2 ops/sec, speed 10 → 100 ops/sec\n\n### `test/VisualScenarios.BugValidation.js`\nUpdated test `#20 \"no UI control for grid size\"` → now asserts UI IS present (feature implemented).\n\n## All Requirements Status\n\n| Requirement | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Algorithm dropdown (accordion in existing app) | Existing |\n| \"Find Path\" / \"Start Search\" button | Existing |\n| \"Clear\" button | Existing |\n| Grid size selector (default 15×15) | **Added iteration 3** |\n| Speed slider for animation speed | **Added iteration 3** |\n| Save Scenario button | Added iteration 2 |\n| Load Scenario button | Added iteration 2 |\n| Preset map dropdown | Added iteration 2 |\n\n## Test Results\n\n```\n576 passing (1s)\n```\n(538 pre-existing + 4 new `getOperationsPerSecond` tests + 34 from other workers; ControlsPanel.js: 27/27 passing — no regressions)\n","numLines":46,"startLine":1,"totalLines":46}}}
